<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr CPI 15.3 pct in June vs 14.6 May.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr CPI 15.3 pct in June vs 14.6 May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish consumer prices rose 1.5 percent in June against a 0.6 percent rise in May, bringing year-on-year inflation up to 15.3 percent, PAP news agency reported quoting the Central Statistical Office (GUS) figures.  </p>
<p> POLISH CONSUMER PRICES     JUNE	 MAY	     JUNE 96</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)    1.5	 0.6	     1.0</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)	   15.3	14.6	    19.5</p>
<p> services m/m change	   0.9	 0.6	     0.5</p>
<p> services yr/yr change	 n.a.     19.3	    19.7</p>
<p> food prices m/m change	2.9	 0.6	     0.9</p>
<p> food prices yr/yr change    n.a	11.8	    16.6</p>
<p>NOTE - revised figures in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
